==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gmh|de}} {{m|gmh|}}, from Greek ''kamelos'', from a Semitic root; compare Arabic ''gamal''.

===Noun===
{{de-noun|n||gen2=Kameles|Kamele}}

# a [[camel]]
# a dumb person

